# === Apocalypse-Express .gitignore ===

# --- Image generation backups (large, ChatGPT alternates — internal only)
docs/img/**/_source/
docs/img/**/_alternates/

# --- OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.bak
*~

# --- Sensitive (just in case — already local-only but safety net)
**/github*token*.txt
**/*.env
**/secrets/

# --- Obsidian internal cache (config IS tracked, but caches aren't)
Vault_Config/workspace*.json.bak
.obsidian/workspace.json.bak

